{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a top scientist at a cutting edge genetic research laboratory, you\u2019re racing to solve the problem of feeding an ever growing population. Your team is overstepping ethical boundaries with gene editing in an attempt to breed a new form of livestock that will grow at 100 times the rate of normal animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after an experiment is mysteriously interfered with, it gives birth to a virally spreading mass of tentacles that is consuming everything in its path and evolving into a creature from hell. You must use your scientific experience to learn how the organism behaves, exploit its weaknesses and fight your way to safety.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENEMY UNKNOWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abomination of flesh and tentacles with a taste for organic matter, constantly evolving and adapting, spreading to consume everything in its path. Use any tools you can find to slice through the creature\u2019s tentacles, target its weak spots and stunt the growth. Escape each floor before the growth mutates into something even more horrific.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/1aa7fbc66e494aa14426d5f1aca01ca2.poster.avif?t=1757409761\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/1aa7fbc66e494aa14426d5f1aca01ca2.webm?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/1aa7fbc66e494aa14426d5f1aca01ca2.mp4?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVOR TEAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in local co-op mode where up to 4 players can attempt to escape the lab together. Choose your character and role carefully and watch each others\u2019 backs - you\u2019ll have to work together to survive this tentacle infested hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/f38438279928a7a18f52b95372480632.poster.avif?t=1757409761\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/f38438279928a7a18f52b95372480632.webm?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/f38438279928a7a18f52b95372480632.mp4?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESOURCEFUL CARNAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your scientific know-how to re-purpose lab equipment and systems to slow down the growth or create a diversion. Manipulate the lab\u2019s layout to lock doors, create new routes and block the creature\u2019s spread. Cobble together experimental weapons and technology to fight your way to safety in an ever changing environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/80ead221927b3bacda1a7c3ef0d8e922.poster.avif?t=1757409761\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/80ead221927b3bacda1a7c3ef0d8e922.webm?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/80ead221927b3bacda1a7c3ef0d8e922.mp4?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOUGH CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room reveals new surprises and tough choices. Sneak past the creature before it spots you or set a trap to swing the fight in your favour? Save a scientist to unlock new equipment or cut your losses and race to the exit? But be careful - even your fellow scientists may be unknowingly carrying a dormant growth waiting to release itself\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/64e4780fad8e5502784bb111ed9f902e.poster.avif?t=1757409761\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/64e4780fad8e5502784bb111ed9f902e.webm?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/64e4780fad8e5502784bb111ed9f902e.mp4?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC ESCAPE ROUTE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each path has different dangers and different rewards, choose your escape route wisely to stay one step ahead of the creature. Every time you play you face a completely different layout but will learn more of the secrets of the lab and how to use them to your advantage to outsmart your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/3cd58ea36b6cbf3618941aacaa959477.poster.avif?t=1757409761\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/3cd58ea36b6cbf3618941aacaa959477.webm?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/3cd58ea36b6cbf3618941aacaa959477.mp4?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1808160?t=1757409761","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757409761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/2080d3e3216411f77d3dead25959be3a3ed8295b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757409761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/2080d3e3216411f77d3dead25959be3a3ed8295b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757409761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains scenes of violence towards fungal and plant-like creatures/monsters. Contains transformation of humans into creatures."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2744940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a top scientist at a cutting edge genetic research laboratory, you\u2019re racing to solve the problem of feeding an ever growing population. Your team is overstepping ethical boundaries with gene editing in an attempt to breed a new form of livestock that will grow at 100 times the rate of normal animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after an experiment is mysteriously interfered with, it gives birth to a virally spreading mass of tentacles that is consuming everything in its path and evolving into a creature from hell. You must use your scientific experience to learn how the organism behaves, exploit its weaknesses and fight your way to safety.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENEMY UNKNOWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abomination of flesh and tentacles with a taste for organic matter, constantly evolving and adapting, spreading to consume everything in its path. Use any tools you can find to slice through the creature\u2019s tentacles, target its weak spots and stunt the growth. Escape each floor before the growth mutates into something even more horrific.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/1aa7fbc66e494aa14426d5f1aca01ca2.poster.avif?t=1757409761\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/1aa7fbc66e494aa14426d5f1aca01ca2.webm?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/1aa7fbc66e494aa14426d5f1aca01ca2.mp4?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVOR TEAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in local co-op mode where up to 4 players can attempt to escape the lab together. Choose your character and role carefully and watch each others\u2019 backs - you\u2019ll have to work together to survive this tentacle infested hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/f38438279928a7a18f52b95372480632.poster.avif?t=1757409761\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/f38438279928a7a18f52b95372480632.webm?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/f38438279928a7a18f52b95372480632.mp4?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESOURCEFUL CARNAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your scientific know-how to re-purpose lab equipment and systems to slow down the growth or create a diversion. Manipulate the lab\u2019s layout to lock doors, create new routes and block the creature\u2019s spread. Cobble together experimental weapons and technology to fight your way to safety in an ever changing environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/80ead221927b3bacda1a7c3ef0d8e922.poster.avif?t=1757409761\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/80ead221927b3bacda1a7c3ef0d8e922.webm?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/80ead221927b3bacda1a7c3ef0d8e922.mp4?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOUGH CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room reveals new surprises and tough choices. Sneak past the creature before it spots you or set a trap to swing the fight in your favour? Save a scientist to unlock new equipment or cut your losses and race to the exit? But be careful - even your fellow scientists may be unknowingly carrying a dormant growth waiting to release itself\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/64e4780fad8e5502784bb111ed9f902e.poster.avif?t=1757409761\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/64e4780fad8e5502784bb111ed9f902e.webm?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/64e4780fad8e5502784bb111ed9f902e.mp4?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC ESCAPE ROUTE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each path has different dangers and different rewards, choose your escape route wisely to stay one step ahead of the creature. Every time you play you face a completely different layout but will learn more of the secrets of the lab and how to use them to your advantage to outsmart your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/3cd58ea36b6cbf3618941aacaa959477.poster.avif?t=1757409761\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/3cd58ea36b6cbf3618941aacaa959477.webm?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/extras/3cd58ea36b6cbf3618941aacaa959477.mp4?t=1757409761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["DinoBoss"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808160/header.jpg?t=1757409761","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1808160/871816/e3eb4b56ce74d8f744c7d1d9c744693c247e74e4/1751034350/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744919489","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1808160/871816/e3eb4b56ce74d8f744c7d1d9c744693c247e74e4/1751034350/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744919489","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1808160/871816/e3eb4b56ce74d8f744c7d1d9c744693c247e74e4/1751034350/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744919489","id":257127006,"name":"Releasing July 2025 with Online Co-op","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.ste